          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"the-close-desk\">The close desk</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">One package in. The cells that need a person, with their evidence.\nEvery decision recorded.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>A blank is an answer.</strong> A cell the pipeline cannot verify is left\nblank and routed here with its source rows \u2014 never guessed. One\nrecorded write path: <code>exceptions.apply_decisions</code>, the same function\nthe CLI and the agent's tools call.</span>\n<blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Local pilot, not a hosted service.</strong> Reviewer identity is\nself-attested, and this runs on your machine. Nothing here posts to a\nledger or writes back to a source workbook.</span>\n</blockquote></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
